(ESC RPM Sweep)

;A fine-grained Electronic Speed Control ramp - Axis 0 from 100 RPM to 390 RPM in 30 steps of 10 RPM,
;each held for 0.2 s. Make sure Axis 0 is properly configured before launching this program.

G1030 X100	(Axis 0, Electronic Speed Control 100 RPM)
G04 P0.2	(Wait for 0.2 seconds)
G1030 X110	(Axis 0, Electronic Speed Control 110 RPM)
G04 P0.2	(Wait for 0.2 seconds)
